## Touchpad

$bindcode XF86TouchpadToggle input type:touchpad events toggle enabled disabled 
# Allow switching between workspaces with left and right swipes
bindgesture swipe:up workspace prev
bindgesture swipe:down workspace next
bindgesture swipe:right focus left
bindgesture swipe:left focus right

